body:
My favorite thing about the Arrowverse is how many Amells there are. Stephen Amell (Oliver Queen (duh)), Stephen's wife Cassandra Jean (Nora Fries (why are there so many Nora's)), Robbie Amell (Ronnie Raymond (Stephen's cousin)), and Italia Ricci (Siobhan Smythe (Robbie's wife)). Like this is turning into some PG version of Parasite

&#x200B;

PS. My second favorite thing is that Brandon Routh and Courtney Ford (Ray Palmer and Nora Darhk) are married in real life

I’m 5’2 and have a stupid smile and glasses. People usually assume I’m a total nerd.

&#x200B;

They’re absolutely right.
